{"id":1839,"name":"Maoujou de Oyasumi","slug":"maoujou_de_oyasumi","synopsis":"Sshhh! Princess Syalis is trying to get a good night's sleep. Some shut-eye. Forty winks. Catch some Z's. Long ago in olden times when people and demons lived together in—well, disharmony, really—a demon king kidnaps a human princess and imprisons her in his castle. Bereft, the princess's subjects beat their chests in anguish…until a hero arises to spearhead Project Rescue Our Princess! While waiting for her knight in shining armor, what's an imprisoned princess to do...? Teddy-bear guards with bat wings are all very well, but her dungeon cell is bo-o-o-ring! So, she decides to wile away the long hours by sleeping. Now if only she could get comfortable…and didn't suffer from insomnia...\n\n(Source: VIZ Media)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2020,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:13","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 05:13:39","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":40397},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":111428},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":42551},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":15095},{"site":"ANN","externalId":23362},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":13975},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":3669,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/VrWIWow9rHpSvB15m2Nw00hUPt22sTB8598hiiEu.png"},{"id":3670,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/B0HThqzurvDNlBXbEoNHNXoqE32sRdFeYsU8VIRs.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":4,"name":"Doga Kobo","slug":"doga_kobo"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":9498,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":9499,"title":"Kaimin! Anmin! Suya Rhyst Seikatsu","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":11168,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":11420,"basename":"MaouJouDeOyasumi-OP1-NCBD1080.webm","filename":"MaouJouDeOyasumi-OP1-NCBD1080","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/MaouJouDe